<p>ran me abru kamaa'n ki aamad hai<br />
asghar-e- bezabaa'n ki aamad hai<br />
bhuke ki natawaa'n ki aamad hai<br />
pyaase ki neemjaa'n ki aamad hai</p>

<p>yahi qaime me shor hota hai<br />
wadaa unka bhi pura hota hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pyaas ne kardiya hai ye aalam<br />
ghash pa ghash aate hai unhe paiham<br />
hilte hai haath paau bhi kam kam<br />
seene me ab nahi samaata dam</p>

<p>gham se matam zado'n ko sakta hai<br />
nanha syed pada sisakta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ro nahi sakte mu banaate hai<br />
aankhe ulti huwi phiraate hai<br />
qushk kaamoo zabaan dikhate hai<br />
ghul se rone ke sehme jaate hai</p>

<p>mu khula hai dhadakti chaati hai<br />
saans bhi ab atakti aati hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>seena garmi ke maare jalta hai<br />
nanha sa dil pada uchalta hai<br />
dam ba dam rang ko badalta hai<br />
bas nahi kuch kisi ka chalta hai</p>

<p>naam paani ka sab jo lete hai<br />
mu ko ghabra ke khol dete hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>roke kehti hai bano-e dilgeer<br />
mai kidhar jaau kya karoo'n tadbeer<br />
haaye bacche mere teri taqdeer<br />
naa to paani mila tujhe naa sheer</p>

<p>haal jab dekhti hai bad, zainab<br />
kehti hai ya ali madad, zainab<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haaye kya waqt hai pada ham par<br />
karne paaye na maatam-e akbar<br />
huwi darpesh rehlate asghar<br />
ab mai nikloongi odh kar chaadar</p>

<p>lashkar-e- sham paas jaaungi<br />
haal besheer ka sunaaungi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kahungi jaake mai hoo'n saidaani<br />
dekho marta hai ye mera jaani<br />
tishnagi ki hai ispa tughyaani<br />
waah kya qoob ki hai mehmani</p>

<p>karo seraab laal ko mere<br />
paani do nounehaal ko mere<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qaime me aaye sarwar-e aalam<br />
jhule se bezubaa'n ko laye haram<br />
sheh ne dekha ke hai labo'n par dam<br />
roke irshad ye kiya paiham</p>

<p>mere jaani mere jigar aao<br />
chalo maida'n ki sair kar aao<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kehke ye ro-e sarwar-e- zeejaah<br />
liya hatho'n pa apna ghirat-e- maah<br />
kiya pinhaa'n abaa me qaatir e qaah<br />
aur kaha lallaaha&ndash; illallah</p>

<p>leke pyase ko ashkbaar chale<br />
pusht qam karke be qaraar chale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>roke kehne lage imaam-e- ghayur<br />
ghafilo kuch nahi hai tum ko shaoor<br />
tum samajhna nahi quda ko door<br />
mere bacche ka kuch nahi hai qusoor</p>

<p>be gunaah ki na jaan lo yaaro<br />
mere kehne ko maan lo yaaro<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zalimo waasta payambar ka<br />
dam nikalta hai mere dilbar ka<br />
tar karo halq mere asghar ka<br />
jaam doonga mai tum ko kausar ka</p>

<p>hurmala bola aab milta hai<br />
tahro tahro jawab milta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bole karta hai kya ghazab zalim<br />
maarta kyu'n hai besabab zalim<br />
paani maangenge ham na ab zalim<br />
sunta tha sheh ka kahna kab zalim</p>

<p>teer abroo kamaan ko maara<br />
che mahine ki jaan ko maara<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>